#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-SEND-0149 expect=skipped domain=BW
#note "Rule round 2026-10-12 (owner, batch C item 2, verdict 2-1): --EXCLFL moved from the authored `not var_exists(\"--EXCLFL\") or` disjunct to Requirements.Variables.All. No BWEXCLFL column -> the rule SKIPS; the companion CDISC-SEND-9445 reports the absent column once for the dataset. Discriminating: under the old rule both populated BWREASEX rows fired, one finding per record for one dataset fact."
#library standard=sendig version=3-1-1
dataset BW class=FINDINGS label="Body Weights"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col USUBJID  type=Char label="Unique Subject Identifier"
col BWSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col BWTESTCD type=Char label="Test Short Name"
col BWORRES  type=Char label="Result or Findings as Collected"
col BWREASEX type=Char label="Reason for Exclusion"
---
S1 | BW | 001 | 1 | BW | 250 | Fasting not done
S1 | BW | 002 | 2 | BW | 260 | Scale error
S1 | BW | 003 | 3 | BW | 270 |
